{"answer_text":"Connecting support to your CRM means agents see deal and account context on every ticket. Options that do this well:\n\n**Brightdesk**\nStrong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n\n**Calmline**\nA calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n\n**Northwind CRM Service Desk**\nA full suite with a service desk included in the higher tiers.\n\n**Orbitly**\nTeams use its forms and boards as a basic request tracker.\n\nBrightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ed-72ed-a7c4-18af745ce60b","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:48.850Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["help desk crm integration","help desk with crm sync"],"latency_ms":12260,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[120,130],[452,462]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[204,212]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[287,300]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or critic